        "body": "Bumps [@speclynx/apidom-ns-openapi-3-1](https://github.com/speclynx/apidom) from 5.0.2 to 5.1.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/releases\">@​speclynx/apidom-ns-openapi-3-1's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v5.1.0</h2>\n<h1><a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/compare/v5.0.2...v5.1.0\">5.1.0</a> (2026-08-09)</h1>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ns-openapi-3-0:</strong> correct sideEffects path to refractor/inspect (<a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/bc096e3cbfdd9a7ca16d9bc730fa9ee26dd0accd\">bc096e3</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>ns:</strong> transfer style in refractor visitors using the concat pattern (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/speclynx/apidom/issues/442\">#442</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/dc483ccebb80877d96e1c62b34781a96dd96b403\">dc483cc</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>yaml:</strong> make YAML style round-trips byte-perfect (comments, raw numbers) (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/speclynx/apidom/issues/441\">#441</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/43dc5b6a19bfe6268f0ecaedf8f099b1990a363d\">43dc5b6</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>datamodel:</strong> support Metadata in cloneDeep and cloneShallow (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/speclynx/apidom/issues/443\">#443</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/8e7e27a7b01223bba13e54c9703a0c1da34a47d6\">8e7e27a</a>), closes <a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/issues/cloneShallow\">cloneDeep/#cloneShallow</a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">@​speclynx/apidom-ns-openapi-3-1's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1><a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/compare/v5.0.2...v5.1.0\">5.1.0</a> (2026-08-09)</h1>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ns-openapi-3-0:</strong> correct sideEffects path to refractor/inspect (<a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/bc096e3cbfdd9a7ca16d9bc730fa9ee26dd0accd\">bc096e3</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>ns:</strong> transfer style in refractor visitors using the concat pattern (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/speclynx/apidom/issues/442\">#442</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/dc483ccebb80877d96e1c62b34781a96dd96b403\">dc483cc</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>yaml:</strong> make YAML style round-trips byte-perfect (comments, raw numbers) (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/speclynx/apidom/issues/441\">#441</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/43dc5b6a19bfe6268f0ecaedf8f099b1990a363d\">43dc5b6</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>datamodel:</strong> support Metadata in cloneDeep and cloneShallow (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/speclynx/apidom/issues/443\">#443</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/8e7e27a7b01223bba13e54c9703a0c1da34a47d6\">8e7e27a</a>), closes <a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/issues/cloneShallow\">cloneDeep/#cloneShallow</a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/2976a9fe41a9eb3a2de387695c41d21603f57c98\"><code>2976a9f</code></a> chore(release): cut the v5.1.0 release [skip ci]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/43dc5b6a19bfe6268f0ecaedf8f099b1990a363d\"><code>43dc5b6</code></a> fix(yaml): make YAML style round-trips byte-perfect (comments, raw numbers) (...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/bc096e3cbfdd9a7ca16d9bc730fa9ee26dd0accd\"><code>bc096e3</code></a> fix(ns-openapi-3-0): correct sideEffects path to refractor/inspect</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/speclynx/apidom/commit/dc483ccebb80877d96e1c62b34781a96dd96b403\"><code>dc483cc</code></a> fix(ns): transfer style in refractor visitors